            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I was assuming all I would need to do is call `mini.icons` setup function.\r\n\r\nNot quite. Icons in this particular part are \"enabled' via [`tweak_lsp_kind()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f6fe169821506a59b2407e3c7a3327562600e0e3/doc/mini-icons.txt#L481). This is both [documented](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f6fe169821506a59b2407e3c7a3327562600e0e3/doc/mini-completion.txt#L61) and [explicitly shown in demo](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/readmes/mini-completion.md#demo).",
            "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I was assuming all I would need to do is call <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.icons</code> setup function.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Not quite. Icons in this particular part are \"enabled' via <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f6fe169821506a59b2407e3c7a3327562600e0e3/doc/mini-icons.txt#L481\"><code class=\"notranslate\">tweak_lsp_kind()</code></a>. This is both <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f6fe169821506a59b2407e3c7a3327562600e0e3/doc/mini-completion.txt#L61\">documented</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/readmes/mini-completion.md#demo\">explicitly shown in demo</a>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "I was assuming all I would need to do is call mini.icons setup function.\n\nNot quite. Icons in this particular part are \"enabled' via tweak_lsp_kind(). This is both documented and explicitly shown in demo.",
